description: Protect Ember's live Godot import cache during automated checks
alwaysApply: true
---

# Godot import-cache safety

- Never launch this working checkout with `--headless --editor`.
- Run targeted tests with `--headless --path . --script res://...`.
- Use `--check-only` when only GDScript parsing is required.
- Run editor/import smoke tests only in a disposable checkout or import cache.
- Keep `addons/at-icons/.gdignore` while the @icons plugin is disabled; removing
  it deliberately enables one GUI import of all 3,708 themed SVG variants.
